        "type": "text/plain",
        "value": "<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <h3>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Front of House Manager \u2013 Ng\u0101 Purapura Caf\u00e9 -\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           EXPIRED\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </h3>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Te W\u0101nanga o Raukawa is seeking a reliable and friendly\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n    <strong>\r\n      \n           Front of House Manager\n          \r\n    </strong>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            to join\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n    <strong>\r\n      \n           Ng\u0101 Purapura Caf\u00e9\n          \r\n    </strong>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           .\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           This role supports the daily running of the caf\u00e9, working closely with the Cook to ensure great service, smooth operations, and a welcoming environment.\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <br/>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <strong>\r\n      \n           M\u0101u e mau mai:\n          \r\n    </strong>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Hospitality experience or relevant qualifications\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Strong customer service and communication skills (English and some te reo M\u0101ori or willingness to learn)\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Ability to multitask, work under pressure, and support kitchen operations\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           A reliable, friendly and team-focused attitude\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <br/>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <strong>\r\n      \n           Ka tukuna e m\u0101tou:\n          \r\n    </strong>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           A kaupapa-driven, supportive work environment\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           The chance to work in a values-based organisation serving our community\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Join our team and help deliver great kai and great manaakitanga every day.\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <br/>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <strong>\r\n      \n           Expiry:\n          \r\n    </strong>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Monday 25 May, 2026\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <br/>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           For further information or to apply for this role, please contact:\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Sam Hata, Te Whare Tiaki Rawa\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u012am\u0113ra: sam.hata@twor.ac.nz\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Waea: 06 3649011\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <br/>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <br/>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>"
      }
